00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.170
There's videos of honey badgers,

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:21.480
which aren't huge animals fighting like...

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.313
- [Kelly] But they're mighty.

00:01:22.313 --> 00:01:25.320
- Lions and they have
like really thick skin

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:26.910
and they're just...
- [Kelly] That is just Nellie.

00:01:26.910 --> 00:01:27.743
