00:01:27.743 --> 00:01:29.189
Like she's very thick skinned.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:32.610
And she just fights anything and anyone

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:33.600
at the drop of a hat.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:34.570
- And I love this trick.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:35.547
- [Margot] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:35.547 --> 00:01:37.350
- And it's helpful 'cause
you do all this research

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.480
and like, you know, there's
tons of research that,

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.400
